COMMENT ON COLUMN text_polish_record.payload IS '必填JSON对象，无默认值；当前键id/input/generatedText/polishedText/sourceRecordId/sourceMode/modelId/modelName/mock/editRevision/checks/historySaved/persistentHistory/createdAt/executionMetadata；input含sourceText/style/depth/audience/requirements/lockedTexts/modelId，lockedTexts为原文精确保留字符串数组；checks为code/message/before/after对象数组。executionMetadata由服务端生成，旧记录缺失或NULL表示未知；包含strategyVersion/skillVersion/resourceHash/repairInstructionHash/routeKey/upstreamModel/parameters/attemptCount，skillVersion为NULL表示未加载技能，resourceHash为基础system指令UTF-8的SHA-256十六进制，repairInstructionHash仅在修复时有值，mock无指令哈希；parameters含maxTokens/maxCompletionTokens/temperature/stream/responseFormat/thinking，仅记录实际发送值，NULL表示未发送或未知；attemptCount为真实尝试次数含协议修复，mock为0。不含供应商端点或密钥。generatedText保留生成原件，当前正文和修订以独立列为准。数据库仅检查顶层对象，不强制内部键和结构';
